<p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">Hi <?= firstName ?>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">The articardd team is working toward a better way to connect your relationships, opportunities, and decisions into one continuous system.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">Our latest update: the ArtiByte Executive Protocol is now integrated into articardd. We're building on that foundation to help professionals do more with the relationships they already have, and discover the ones they haven't made yet.</p>

<!-- 02 FOUR PILLARS -->
<p style="margin:28px 0 6px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#b06f2c;">Connect · Discover · Decide · Continue</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

<tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 0 14px 0;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;"><tr><td width="32" height="32" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#f6efe6" style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;background:#f6efe6;font-family:'Segoe UI Symbol','Arial Unicode MS',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:32px;font-weight:600;color:#b06f2c;">⇄</td></tr></table>
<div style="font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;font-weight:500;color:#111318;padding:0 0 4px 0;">Connect: your contacts, one gesture away</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;">We're developing a more intuitive contact experience. Simply slide a contact to reveal quick actions for calling, emailing, or sending an iMessage or text. Spend less time navigating menus and more time building relationships.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:8px;">Your contacts should be more than names in a database. They should be the starting point for meaningful action.</div></td></tr>

<tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 0 14px 0;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;"><tr><td width="32" height="32" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#f6efe6" style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;background:#f6efe6;font-family:'Segoe UI Symbol','Arial Unicode MS',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:32px;font-weight:600;color:#b06f2c;">⌕</td></tr></table>
<div style="font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;font-weight:500;color:#111318;padding:0 0 4px 0;">Discover: find opportunities beyond your network</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;">We're working toward an AI-powered Human Discovery Engine designed to help you explore relevant people, jobs, projects, collaborations, and business opportunities.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:8px;">Instead of relying entirely on who you already know, imagine being able to discover who you should meet, what opportunities may fit your goals, and where your next collaboration could begin. The objective is to help you turn connections into possibilities, and possibilities into action.</div></td></tr>

<tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 0 14px 0;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;"><tr><td width="32" height="32" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#f6efe6" style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:10px;background:#f6efe6;font-family:'Segoe UI Symbol','Arial Unicode MS',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:32px;font-weight:600;color:#b06f2c;">◈</td></tr></table>
<div style="font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;font-weight:500;color:#111318;padding:0 0 4px 0;">Decide: a smarter way to think and act</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;">With the Executive Protocol integrated into articardd, we're building toward a more structured way to support decision-making for CEOs, founders, consultants, and freelancers. It is designed to bring greater structure to complex decisions, preserve important context, and help connect goals, relationships, priorities, and next steps.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:8px;">For a founder, that could mean evaluating an opportunity. For a CEO, organizing priorities. For a freelancer, identifying the next project or client relationship worth pursuing.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:8px;">The goal is not to replace human judgment. It is to help you make more informed decisions, maintain direction, and spend your attention where it matters most.</div></td></tr>

<tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 0 14px 0;">
