<div style="font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:21px;font-weight:500;color:#111318;padding:0 0 4px 0;">Continue: AI Notes · Mitochondria · Continuity</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;">We're also developing a more connected approach to capturing and carrying forward knowledge.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;color:#111318;">AI Notes</strong> help organize important information, insights, decisions, and follow-ups.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:6px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;color:#111318;">Mitochondria</strong> is part of our broader vision for preserving the underlying context and supporting the continuity of your work.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:6px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;color:#111318;">Continuity</strong> is the principle that important context, commitments, and next steps should carry forward instead of being lost between conversations, meetings, and projects.</div>
<div style="font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#6b7078;padding-top:8px;">Together, these concepts point toward a system that does more than store information. It helps keep your work connected over time.</div></td></tr>
