<!-- 03 WHY THIS MATTERS -->
<p style="margin:28px 0 10px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#b06f2c;">Why this matters</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">For founders, executives, and independent professionals, productivity is not simply about doing more tasks. It is about making better decisions, finding the right people, recognizing opportunities, and following through consistently.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">That is the direction we're pursuing with articardd and the Executive Protocol: a more intelligent relationship and opportunity system designed to help you multiply your productive capacity, strengthen your business relationships, and create more opportunities for revenue growth.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">Our ambition is to help you work toward 10× greater output and opportunity, not through another disconnected tool, but through a system that connects your network, knowledge, and actions.</p>

<!-- 04 PRINCIPLE -->
<p style="margin:28px 0 10px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:#b06f2c;">One evolving system. Your network. Your continuity.</p>
<div style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;font-size:18px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#111318;">Your identity. Your contacts. Your control.</div>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">articardd began with that simple principle. We're building on it so your professional network can become more useful, more connected, and more valuable over time.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 28px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#3f444c;">More capabilities are in development as the articardd team continues working toward the best way to put AI to work for people: not just to generate answers, but to support meaningful decisions, relationships, and progress. Thank you for being part of the journey.</p>
